    "plan": {
      "summary": "1) arbit_model.teams: FRANCHISE map (OAK->LV, SD->LAC, STL->LA; roster codes ARZ->ARI, BLT->BAL, CLV->CLE, HST->HOU, SL->LA), franchise() and a polars expression. 2) targets.py normalizes every team field of SeasonRows (schedule, plays, statistics, snaps, rosters) and refuses (TeamCodeError) a statistics or team row whose franchise is not one of its game's two teams. 3) gamebook and team_features map schedule codes; gamebooks read regular-season games only (R-074). 4) build_targets.py --inputs-of INDEX pins every manifest an earlier index read and --set-current moves the pointer for a repair build; targets_diff.py classifies every changed row between two indexes. 5) Rebuild 2012-2026 pinned to 4afbd836, diff, require every change to touch a relocated or roster-coded team. 6) ffa_signal_study_r072.py reruns the locked study with pinned manifests and franchise-mapped schedules; update the eight TEAM shrinkage constants. 7) DvP: targets_index moves to the repaired index, v0_targets_index keeps 4afbd836, reproduce-v0 stages a pointer to the old index so v0 still reproduces; rerun phase 1 audit. 8) Tests, records, docs.",
